		line=352,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A little past nine PM.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I head to the Government-General on summons from my father, the governor-general of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The grounds of the Government-General are vast.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"According to a document I once read, it measures 2300 meters north to south and 1500 meters east to west.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"It takes over ten minutes to walk from the front gates to the building where the headquarters is located.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“At ease, men.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I give the guards at the gate a salute and have my car proceed forward.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"As soon as I enter the compound, I'm greeted by orderly ranks of tanks and armored vehicles.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"There are always ten thousand soldiers stationed at the Government-General in case of an emergency in Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"This is surely a symbol of dread for Imperials.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"But there is even more to our might than just this garrison.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Ten thousand more troops are stationed at another base in the occupation zone, and a further forty thousand on the outskirts of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Across the entire country, there are at least an additional hundred thousand.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Without a modern military, the Empire should be entirely powerless to fight the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"And yet, when it comes to the warriors...",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They sure don't know when to throw in the towel.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The first thing that greets me upon entering his office is my father─the governor-general's frigid gaze.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I stifle a sigh and stand at attention.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That transport convoy. Was it the warriors' doing again?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Based on the damage reports from the vehicles, I believe it is the only explanation.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Why allow them to continue getting away with it?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It's about time you round them all up and dispose of them as you see fit.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"The governor-general reclines back into his chair and lights his pipe.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(I hate this smell.)”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"A cloyingly sweet smell spreads throughout the room.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"This scent used to remind me of my father, of comfortable and peaceful times, but now I feel nothing but contempt for it.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is not as though all warriors are possessed of dangerous ideologies.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Approximately seventy percent of the warriors have laid down their arms and live now as ordinary citizens.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is out of the question to arrest upstanding citizens.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"His face is at odds with his words, betraying that he does not understand in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Rather than going to the tiresome trouble of sorting black from white, by his thinking, we may as well just burn them all to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"For the Republic and the various territories it militarily occupies across the world, perhaps that is an effective policy.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(But it's far too crude...)”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I know I can do much better than that.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have been entrusted with maintaining public order in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“And what might your plans be for this country?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wish to nurture the seeds of democracy and govern it peacefully.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To that end, the Republic should─”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“No need for that.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Is this not the cause the Republic fights for?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I did not call you here to have a debate.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Liberating dictatorships and spreading democracy is the reason the Republic wages wars all over the world.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Of course, this is all just a pretext.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The real reason it keeps waging war is that it simply can't afford to stop.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"The political economy of the Republic is by now completely dependent on war.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"For the Republic, ceasing its hostilities would be akin to an agrarian society salting its own fields.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Even so, I'm going to make this pretext into a reality.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I welcome him to frown on what I'll make out of this sham democracy.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“On a different but related matter, it appears that someone is selling intel to the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I changed the date and time of the convoy on short notice, but even this was leaked.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Don't give out anything you don't want leaked. It's that simple.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I will be more careful moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Any fool can try to be careful.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Do ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" make any more mistakes. Got it? Good.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I suppress my displeasure and turn on my heel.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I don't want to remain a single second longer than necessary.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I'm putting you in charge of security for the Armistice Day ceremony next week.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The Armistice Day ceremony is March 20th... That's next Sunday.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"That same weekend, Tenkyo will be bustling with the Persica Blossom Festival in full swing.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Arranging security will be a huge headache.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That is only ten days away.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I am afraid I lack the requisite time to establish a thorough security protocol.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I already put you in charge. Now get it done.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I shall put forth every effort to produce a satisfactory result.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“This year's ceremony will be a joyous day for both countries.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Do not allow some lousy agitators to ruin it.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"What is he planning to do at this year's ceremony?",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"In all likelihood, he's prepared lavish gifts for the dignitaries visiting from the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Though he's never far from the battlefield, this man's eyes are always set on Congress back home.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Waging war is just a means to an end for him to gain political influence in Congress.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"They say Okonogi is the one funding his lobbying.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"It goes without saying that Okonogi's funds are misappropriated from Imperial citizens.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Albeit indirectly, my father is still squeezing the Imperial people for all they're worth; he says it's his right as the victor to do as he wills.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I refuse to believe that Okonogi and my father are even flesh-and-blood human beings.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"No, they are different lifeforms entirely... It wouldn't be wrong to think of them as monsters.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you'll excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I pass through the red-carpeted hallways and exit the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Ugh, I feel sick.)”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I impulsively brush at my uniform with my hands.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I know it's useless, but I want to get rid of the smell of his smoke from my body.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I swear... just look what the warriors had to put me through by attacking those transports.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Those stupid idiots!",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"It's all thanks to them that I'm in such a bad mood.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Even after the August Incident, there are still warriors with dangerous ideologies running amok.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Until I deal with them for good, the Empire will never know peace.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I'm just so sick and tired of always hearing gunshots ringing out from somewhere or other in the city.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"As I'm cooling my head, a car pulls up right to the edge of the guardrail.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"First Lieutenant Rochel and a woman who looks to be his adjutant step out.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Good evening, Senior Colonel Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, it's you.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I just heard what happened to that transport convoy.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“The army is also having a hard time dealing with attacks from the warriors. I hope you can apprehend them sooner rather than later.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know...”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“We're counting on you, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"His gentle eyes project a simplicity that feels completely out of place for a soldier.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"It's the callow face of an aristocrat who hasn't ever known hardship.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"It makes me instinctively dislike him.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Now then, please excuse us.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Rochel and the woman enter the building.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(The warriors...)”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"They lurk in the shadows and attack with an agility that defies human comprehension.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Even the most expensive and cutting-edge military hardware is powerless against them.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"One after another of our soldiers are cut down by these too-swift enemies.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"The warriors are demons.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Demons who prowl the dark streets of Tenkyo and hunt the heads of its conquerors.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(I have to crush them.)”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Unbidden, the faces of Inou-san and Tokita-kun appear in my mind.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
